00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.170
Abraham: Interpersonal skills are
the skills required to effectively

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:07.150
communicate, interact, and work
with individuals and groups alike

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:11.290
and these skills are important for
success especially in cyber security.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.950
It is important to remember that cyber
security does not exist in isolation.

00:00:16.709 --> 00:00:19.950
There is a strong human factor
involved just consider how many

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.819
breaches are initiated by ‘phishing.’

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:26.480
Nicole: Cyber security professionals
must be able to effectively interact

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:30.849
with all levels and departments
within an organisation and educate

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.900
other members of staff about cyber
security threats that affect the whole

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.080
organisation including themselves.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:40.080
So, what exactly are interpersonal skills?

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:42.230
Abraham: Interpersonal skills include

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.660
—
• The ability to listen.

00:00:44.139 --> 00:00:46.900
• Good verbal and non-verbal
communication abilities.

00:00:47.309 --> 00:00:50.940
• The ability to question others and give
information in response to questioning.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:53.800
• Respecting the views
and opinions of others.

00:00:54.279 --> 00:00:59.104
• Putting across personal views
clearly and appropriately.

00:00:59.104 --> 00:01:00.362
• Giving and receiving feedback

00:01:00.362 --> 00:01:02.330
• The ability to clarify thoughts and views.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:05.170
• Working well and collaborating with others

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:06.610
• Being self-aware

00:01:06.719 --> 00:01:07.949
• And having empathy

00:01:10.609 --> 00:01:14.533
Nicole: Cyber security is not just
an IT problem it affects everyone

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:16.588
in a company and organisation.

00:01:16.588 --> 00:01:20.698
As more departments rely on digital
communication and technologies, then

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:25.219
cyber vulnerabilities will increase,
and cyber security professionals

00:01:25.219 --> 00:01:29.719
will be called upon to resolve issues
across a range of areas making good

00:01:29.719 --> 00:01:31.510
use of their interpersonal skills.

